\":\"user\",\"about_me_summary\":\"HE’S BACKKKKKKK\\n✦ achievements here ✦\\n\\n  \\n\\n\\nI’m on a mission; don’t distract me.\\nOne RRR, one day! You can join too, here. (so much for staying consistent)\\n\\n3,000 IQ – May 24, 2025\\n4,000 IQ – August 1, 2025\\n5,000 IQ – August 29, 2025 (1000 IQ in one month is crazy! – for me)\\n6,000 IQ – September 7, 2025 (I’m on crack)\\n\\nWas granted the transcriber role between these dates.\\n\\n7,000 IQ – September 13, 2025 (Dedication)\\n8,000 IQ – September 26, 2025 (I gotta do my job, ya know)\\n9,000 IQ – October 4, 2025 (Power!)\\n13,000 IQ – October 5, 2025 (Some may say I was high on meth for this kind of leap, lol)\\nFUN FACT: I also reached Top 3 on the leaderboard today :)\\n15,000 IQ – I don’t even know when I reached 15k, but it should be around November 1, 2025.\\n16,000 IQ – November 7, 2025\\n18,000 IQ – November 8, 2025\\n19,000 IQ – November 9, 2025\\n22,000 IQ – November 10, 2025\\n(Haven’t been keeping track, damn)\\n27,000 IQ – November 15, 2025 – All Hail the Scribe Series\\nDecember 12, 2025 – Bro fumbled!\\n33,700 IQ – December 23, 2025\\n\\n2026 – New year, new role (I beg of thee)\\n\\n34,400 IQ – January 4, 2026\\n36,000 IQ – January 11, 2026\\n37,400 IQ – January 13, 2026\\n38,200 IQ – January 20, 2026\\n39,300 IQ – January 29, 2026\\n\\nThank you so much! I’ve been reinstated, guys!!! – April 27, 2026\\n\\n43,300 IQ – April 28, 2026\\n51,755 IQ – June 24, 2026\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPre 25K IQ graph (in 2025)\",\"api_path\":\"/users/22696076\",\"avatar\":{\"tiny\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/tiny/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":16,\"height\":16}},\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/thumb/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":32,\"height\":32}},\"small\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/small/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":100,\"height\":100}},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/medium/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":300,\"height\":400}}},\"header_image_url\":\"https://assets.genius.com/images/default_banner.png?1786736927\",\"human_readable_role_for_display\":\"Transcriber\",\"id\":22696076,\"iq\":65667,\"is_meme_verified\":false,\"is_verified\":false,\"login\":\"infinitehoax\",\"name\":\"infinitehoax\",\"role_for_display\":\"transcriber\",\"url\":\"https://genius.com/infinitehoax\",\"current_user_metadata\":{\"permissions\":[],\"excluded_permissions\":[\"follow\"],\"interactions\":{\"following\":false}}}}],\"cosigned_by\":[],\"created_by\":{\"_type\":\"user\",\"about_me_summary\":\"HE’S BACKKKKKKK\\n✦ achievements here ✦\\n\\n  \\n\\n\\nI’m on a mission; don’t distract me.\\nOne RRR, one day! You can join too, here. (so much for staying consistent)\\n\\n3,000 IQ – May 24, 2025\\n4,000 IQ – August 1, 2025\\n5,000 IQ – August 29, 2025 (1000 IQ in one month is crazy! – for me)\\n6,000 IQ – September 7, 2025 (I’m on crack)\\n\\nWas granted the transcriber role between these dates.\\n\\n7,000 IQ – September 13, 2025 (Dedication)\\n8,000 IQ – September 26, 2025 (I gotta do my job, ya know)\\n9,000 IQ – October 4, 2025 (Power!)\\n13,000 IQ – October 5, 2025 (Some may say I was high on meth for this kind of leap, lol)\\nFUN FACT: I also reached Top 3 on the leaderboard today :)\\n15,000 IQ – I don’t even know when I reached 15k, but it should be around November 1, 2025.\\n16,000 IQ – November 7, 2025\\n18,000 IQ – November 8, 2025\\n19,000 IQ – November 9, 2025\\n22,000 IQ – November 10, 2025\\n(Haven’t been keeping track, damn)\\n27,000 IQ – November 15, 2025 – All Hail the Scribe Series\\nDecember 12, 2025 – Bro fumbled!\\n33,700 IQ – December 23, 2025\\n\\n2026 – New year, new role (I beg of thee)\\n\\n34,400 IQ – January 4, 2026\\n36,000 IQ – January 11, 2026\\n37,400 IQ – January 13, 2026\\n38,200 IQ – January 20, 2026\\n39,300 IQ – January 29, 2026\\n\\nThank you so much! I’ve been reinstated, guys!!! – April 27, 2026\\n\\n43,300 IQ – April 28, 2026\\n51,755 IQ – June 24, 2026\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPre 25K IQ graph (in 2025)\",\"api_path\":\"/users/22696076\",\"avatar\":{\"tiny\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/tiny/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":16,\"height\":16}},\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/thumb/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":32,\"height\":32}},\"small\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/small/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":100,\"height\":100}},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/medium/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":300,\"height\":400}}},\"header_image_url\":\"https://assets.genius.com/images/default_banner.png?1786736927\",\"human_readable_role_for_display\":\"Transcriber\",\"id\":22696076,\"iq\":65667,\"is_meme_verified\":false,\"is_verified\":false,\"login\":\"infinitehoax\",\"name\":\"infinitehoax\",\"role_for_display\":\"transcriber\",\"url\":\"https://genius.com/infinitehoax\",\"current_user_metadata\":{\"permissions\":[],\"excluded_permissions\":[\"follow\"],\"interactions\":{\"following\":false}}},\"rejection_comment\":null,\"top_comment\":null,\"verified_by\":null}]},\"featured_artists\":[],\"lyrics_marked_complete_by\":null,\"lyrics_marked_staff_approved_by\":null,\"media\":[],\"primary_artist\":{\"_type\":\"artist\",\"api_path\":\"/artists/5058703\",\"header_image_url\":\"https://assets.genius.com/images/default_banner.png?1786736927\",\"id\":5058703,\"image_url\":\"https://assets.genius.com/images/default_cover_image.png?1786736927\",\"index_character\":\"t\",\"is_meme_verified\":false,\"is_verified\":false,\"links_config\":null,\"name\":\"Tharanee\",\"slug\":\"Tharanee\",\"url\":\"https://genius.com/artists/Tharanee\"},\"primary_artists\":[{\"_type\":\"artist\",\"api_path\":\"/artists/5058703\",\"header_image_url\":\"https://a